# /paste and Ctrl-V. First with the harness's do-nothing osascript (the read
# claims success and writes no file), then with `clipimage`, whose osascript
# writes shot.png where the clipboard script asks: two badges, no notice,
# `/images` naming each by its session copy, and a prompt that sends both.
models models-image.json
gateway image-turns.json
work image-ws
wait 5
type /paste
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap paste-none
key C-v
wait 1.5
snap ctrl-v-none
clipimage image-ws/shot.png
type /paste
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap paste
key C-v
wait 1.5
snap ctrl-v
type  /images
key Enter
wait 1
snap images
type what is this?
key Enter
wait 4
snap sent
snapfull end
gwlog
